{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-04","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"spst_16-04","title":"無前","storyCode":"EG-10","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_16-04.txt","sourceHash":"2590e1655ed706e739f17325c9b47a00d8b6e4b56d037be66da463fd4927ed77","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"善人的布施，終將抵達大地的每一個角落。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北邊界，荒野</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跑……不動……了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就到，這裡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那邊好像有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……不，請讓我去吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺到那只是一個受過許多苦痛的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脫力、脫水，而且許久未曾進食……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，他也是我們的同胞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請您救救他吧，就像您救我們所有人一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再一次施行您的神蹟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是神蹟……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病不是使他如此痛苦的主要原因，我只能讓他不再因疾病而疼痛，卻不能幫助他飽腹、給他喝乾淨的水、讓他有安全的地方入睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法施行神蹟，我並非全能，我只是……相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您總是這麼謙遜，我們都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先生，您還能聽見我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我會握住您的手……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信吧。相信我們的生命。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信我們的身體與思維，相信我們心臟的每一次律動，相信我們肺葉的每一次收放。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“相信我們自身，是所有力量的來源。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從此，您不必在死亡的恐懼中殘喘。"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石在體內迅速生長帶來的疼痛逐漸遠去。\n他仍能聽見那些聲音，卻不再因此痛得輾轉反側。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你救了我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我該怎麼，感謝你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以像這裡所有的兄弟姊妹一樣，稱呼我為“希爾達”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神蹟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達再一次救了我們的同胞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她救了我們所有人，只是用母親一樣的撫摸，就像剛才一樣，抹去了所有的病痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"許多人的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達……希爾達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，那是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你長什麼樣子？無論是你，還是其他說話的人，我都看不清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的頭上有傷，是跑得太急，在哪裡跌倒了，因此撞破頭了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是腦中的瘀血讓您看不清楚。沒關係，我們可以攙扶著您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請告訴我，您接下來想去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就先跟我們一起吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您要帶我們去一個沒有痛苦的地方，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，只要你們仍願意與我同行……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g9_seasurface_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
